- `graph::graph_items::node::Node` has a name and attributes.
- `graph::graph_items::edge::Edge` has two endpoints and attributes.

**Builder methods**
- Each type has a `new(...)` constructor and a `with_attrs(&[(&str, &str)])` method that returns `Self`, so calls can be chained.
- `Graph` also has `with_nodes(&[Node])` and `with_edges(&[Edge])`.

**Lookup methods**
