Tests compare triplets with equals, so I've implemented `equals`, `hashCode` and `toString` on `PythagoreanTriplet`.

The builder finds all triplets that sum to N, optionally capped by a maximum factor. For each candidate `a`, it solves for `b` directly using `b = (N² - 2Na) / (2(N - a))`, so the search runs in O(N). Results are returned in ascending order of `a`.

